cff-version: 1.2.0
title: mitoloop_v0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with the data
  resources and methods listed in the README.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Trimouille
    given-names: Aurélien
repository-code: "https://github.com/atrimbdx/mitoloop_v0"
abstract: >-
  A pipeline combining GTEx cis-eQTLs, ENCODE-rE2G element-gene links and
  ENCODE intact Hi-C maps to describe the regulatory landscape of
  nuclear-encoded mitochondrial genes: eQTL effect sizes and TSS distances
  against matched controls, replicability of element-gene links across
  biosamples, promoter loops called on virtual 4C profiles, and the relation
  between loop strength and mitochondrial DNA copy number across tissues.
keywords:
  - mitochondria
  - Hi-C
  - virtual 4C
  - chromatin loops
  - enhancer
  - ENCODE
  - GTEx
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
